  "description": "The construction of 2 x 2Bed Houses and 4 x 3Bed Houses with associated hard and soft landscaping as well as the rearrangement of footpaths and the communal amenity space on the former garage area. (Re-consultation [amended description]) [Revised scheme including two terraces each comprising of two three storey and one two storey house comprising of 2 x 2B4P an 4 x 3B5P homes. The new terraces will align with the existing row of houses on Lewisham Road and to Morden Street. The existing trees facing Lewisham Road and Morden Street are to be removed and the proposal provides tree replacement along the new open space areas orientated towards the centre of the site]",
